<document>
  <properties>
    <title>Download ${project.name} Source</title>
  </properties>

  <body>
    <section name="Download ${project.name} ${project.version} Source">

      <p><strong>${project.name} ${project.version}</strong> is available in source format.</p>

      <p>If you want to build <strong>${project.name}</strong> yourself, use a source archive.</p>

      <p>Otherwise, use the binary artifacts from the <strong>central repository</strong>.</p>

      <p><strong>${project.name}</strong> is distributed under the <a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/">Apache License, version 2.0</a>.</p>

      <subsection name="Files">
        
        <p>This is the current stable version of <strong>${project.name}</strong>.</p>

        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th></th>
              <th>Link</th>
              <th>Checksum</th>
              <th>Signature</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>${project.name} ${project.version} (Source zip)</td>
              <td><a href="https://dlcdn.apache.org/maven/plugins/${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip">${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://downloads.apache.org/maven/plugins/${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip.sha512">${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip.sha512</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://downloads.apache.org/maven/plugins/${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip.asc">${project.artifactId}-${project.version}-source-release.zip.asc</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>You must <a href="https://www.apache.org/info/verification.html">verify the integrity</a> of the downloaded file.
          Use the checksum (.sha512 file) or the signature (.asc file) with the public
          <a href="https://downloads.apache.org/maven/KEYS">KEYS</a> of the Apache Maven developers.
        </p>

      </subsection>

      <subsection name="Previous Versions">
        <p>Use the latest release version of <strong>${project.name}</strong> to get the newest features and bug fixes.</p>
        <p>You can find older releases on the <a href="https://archive.apache.org/dist/maven/plugins/">archive site</a>.</p>
      </subsection>
    </section>
  </body>
</document>

